vtebench-derived material
=========================

The workload definitions, Swift workload generators, and captured Vim session
resources in this directory are based on vtebench:

    https://github.com/alacritty/vtebench
    revision ead80032e57dee2e75f0b51f2ea67528647d9944

vtebench authors include:

    Christian Duerr <contact@christianduerr.com>
    Joe Wilm <joe@jwilm.com>
    vtebench contributors

vtebench offers its work under either of these licenses, at your option:

    Apache License, Version 2.0
    MIT License

The complete license texts are included in:

    Licenses/LICENSE-APACHE
    Licenses/LICENSE-MIT

The Swift files are ports and contain modifications from the original shell
workload generators. The captured Vim session resources are unmodified copies.
See VTEBENCH-NOTICE.md for resource checksums.

This notice applies to the vtebench-derived material. The main SwiftTerm
repository license applies to other SwiftTerm material.
